<title>JAPAN: Tokyo aluminium futures market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo aluminium futures market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo aluminium futures market is closed for a national holiday on Monday. Trading activity will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the market closed mixed, with prices ranging from 0.7 yen per kg higher to 3.1 yen weaker. The benchmark April 1998 contract was down 1.2 yen at 209.0 yen.</p>
</text>
